{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50743","headline":"池州周员外出柘枝 · 张祜","name":"池州周员外出柘枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红筵高设画堂开，小妓粧成爲舞催。\n珠帽着听歌遍匝，锦靴行踏鼓声来。\n纤纤玉笋罗衫撮，戢戢金星钿带回。\n长恐周瑜一私顾，不教闲客望瑶台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}